Frequency of $\operatorname{siren}(v)=800 \mathrm{~Hz}$ Speed of $\operatorname{siren}\left(v_s\right)=v-v_0=30 \mathrm{~m} / \mathrm{s}$ Velocity of listener $\left(v_0\right)=0$ and velocity of sound $(v)=330 \mathrm{~m} / \mathrm{s}$.
From the Doppler's law, frequency heard from siren when it is going away from a listener is

